          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>] al-Sa\u02bf\u012bd. His correspondences in each [</li>\n<li>] a dinar doesn&rsquo;t generate from this in these [</li>\n<li>]&hellip;every (?) installment, for the reason that these districts(?)</li>\n<li>] were it not for my fear of his disapproval, instead of my letter</li>\n<li>]......it cannot be conveyed through correspondence</li>\n<li>] or in letters, and for his being&hellip;. after this time</li>\n<li>] what he narrated, and he knew of its certainty, because God, the exalted</li>\n<li>] knows the zeal of his slave in performing His service. I swear by God</li>\n<li>] on this [vacat], his slave will correspond with</li>\n<li>]&hellip;&hellip;..and others</li>\n<li>and to the lofty presence] belongs the lofty opinion</li></ol>\n",
